msgid "Model style"
msgstr "Stíl mhúnla"

msgid ""
"Field names should be all lowercase, using underscores instead of camelCase."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh ainmneacha réimse le litreacha beaga uile, ag úsáid béim "
"in ionad CamelCase."

msgid ""
"The ``class Meta`` should appear *after* the fields are defined, with a "
"single blank line separating the fields and the class definition."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh an `aicme Meta`` le feiceáil* tar éis * na réimsí a "
"shainiú, le líne bán amháin a scarann na réimsí agus an sainmhíniú ranga."

msgid ""
"The order of model inner classes and standard methods should be as follows "
"(noting that these are not all required):"
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh ord ranganna istigh samhail agus modhanna caighdeánacha "
"mar seo a leanas (ag tabhairt faoi deara nach bhfuil siad seo uile ag "
"teastáil):"

msgid "All database fields"
msgstr "Gach réimse bunachar sonraí"

msgid "Custom manager attributes"
msgstr "Tréithe bainisteoir saincheaptha"

msgid "``class Meta``"
msgstr "``Aicme Meta``"

