"once as part of the release process."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le Sphinx leathanach láimhe a ghiniúint don ordú:doc: `django-"
"admin` </ref/django-admin>. Tá sé seo cumraithe i `docs/conf.py``. Murab "
"ionann agus aschur doiciméadaithe eile, ba chóir an leathanach fear seo a "
"áireamh i stóras Django agus na heisiúintí mar `docs/man/django-admin.1``. "
"Ní gá an comhad seo a nuashonrú agus an doiciméad á nuashonrú, mar go "
"ndéantar é a nuashonrú uair amháin mar chuid den phróiseas scaoilte."

msgid ""
"To generate an updated version of the man page, in the ``docs`` directory, "
"run:"
msgstr ""

msgid "The new man page will be written in ``docs/_build/man/django-admin.1``."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django Deprecation Timeline"
msgstr "Amlíne Díscaoileadh Django"

msgid ""
"This document outlines when various pieces of Django will be removed or "
"altered in a backward incompatible way, following their deprecation, as per "
"the :ref:`deprecation policy <internal-release-deprecation-policy>`. More "
"details about each item can often be found in the release notes of two "
"versions prior."
msgstr ""
"<internal-release-deprecation-policy>Tugann an doiciméad seo leagtar amach "
"cathain a bhainfear píosaí éagsúla de Django nó a athrófar ar bhealach neamh-"
"chomhoiriúnach ar chúl, tar éis a ndíscrúdú, de réir na:ref: `beartas "
"díscoilteoireachta `. Is minic gur féidir tuilleadh sonraí faoi gach mír a "
"fháil i nótaí scaoilte dhá leagan roimhe seo."

msgid "6.1"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Django 5.2 release notes <deprecated-features-5.2>` for more "
"details on these changes."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``all`` keyword argument of "
"``django.contrib.staticfiles.finders.find()`` will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fallbacks to ``request.user`` and ``request.auser()`` when ``user`` is "
"``None`` in ``django.contrib.auth.login()`` and "
"``django.contrib.auth.alogin()``, respectively, will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``ordering`` keyword argument of the PostgreSQL specific aggregation "
"functions ``django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.ArrayAgg``, "
"``django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.JSONBAgg``, and "
"``django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.StringAgg`` will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Support for subclasses of ``RemoteUserMiddleware`` that override "
"``process_request()`` without overriding ``aprocess_request()`` will be "
"removed."
msgstr ""

msgid "6.0"
msgstr "6.0"

msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Django 5.0 release notes <deprecated-features-5.0>` for more "
"details on these changes."
msgstr ""
"Féach na:ref: `Nótaí scaoileadh Django 5.0 <deprecated-features-5.0>`le "
"haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí faoi na hathruithe seo."

msgid ""
"The ``DjangoDivFormRenderer`` and ``Jinja2DivFormRenderer`` transitional "
"form renderers will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Bainfear na léiritheoirí foirme idirthréimhseacha ``DjangoDivFormRenderer`` "
"agus ``Jinja2DivFormRenderer``."

msgid ""
"Support for passing positional arguments to ``BaseConstraint`` will be "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Bainfear tacaíocht chun argóintí seasaimh a chur chuig `BaseConstraint``."

msgid ""
"``request`` will be required in the signature of "
"``ModelAdmin.lookup_allowed()`` subclasses."
msgstr ""
"Beidh ``iarratas ``ag teastáil i síniú fo-aicmí ``ModelAdmin.lookup_allowed "
"()``."

msgid ""
"The ``django.db.models.sql.datastructures.Join`` will no longer fallback to "
"``get_joining_columns()``."
msgstr ""
"Ní thiocfaidh an `Django.db.Models.sql.DataStructures.join`` ar ais chuig "
"``get_joining_column () ``a thuilleadh."

msgid ""
"The ``get_joining_columns()`` method of ``ForeignObject`` and "
"``ForeignObjectRel`` will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Bainfear an modh ``get_joining_column () ``de `ForeignObject`` agus "
"``ForeignObjectrel``."

msgid ""
"The ``ForeignObject.get_reverse_joining_columns()`` method will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear an modh ``ForeignObject.get_Reverse_joining_Columns () ``."

msgid ""
"The default scheme for ``forms.URLField`` will change from ``\"http\"`` to "
"``\"https\"``."
msgstr ""
"Athróidh an scéim réamhshocraithe do ``Forms.URLField`` ó ``\"http\"`` go "
"``\"https\"``."

msgid ""
"Support for calling ``format_html()`` without passing args or kwargs will be "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Bainfear tacaíocht chun glaoch ar ``format_html () ``gan args nó kwargs a "
"rith."

msgid "Support for ``cx_Oracle`` will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear tacaíocht do ``CX_Oracle``."

msgid "``BaseDatabaseOperations.field_cast_sql()`` will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear ``BaseDatabaseOperations.field_cast_sql () ``."

msgid ""
"The ``ChoicesMeta`` alias to ``django.db.models.enums.ChoicesType`` will be "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Bainfear an ailias ``ChoiceSmeta`` chuig "
"``Django.db.Models.Enums.ChoiceStype``."

msgid "The ``Prefetch.get_current_queryset()`` method will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear an modh ``Prefetch.get_current_querySet () ``."

msgid ""
"The ``get_prefetch_queryset()`` method of related managers and descriptors "
"will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Bainfear an modh ``get_prefetch_queryset () ``de bhainisteoirí agus "
"tuairiscí gaolmhara."

msgid ""
"``get_prefetcher()`` and ``prefetch_related_objects()`` will no longer "
"fallback to ``get_prefetch_queryset()``."
msgstr ""
"Ní thiocfaidh ``get_prefetcher () ``agus ``prefetch_related_objects ()`` ar "
"ais chuig ``get_prefetch_queryset () ``a thuilleadh."

msgid ""
"The ``FORMS_URLFIELD_ASSUME_HTTPS`` transitional setting will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear an socrú idirthréimhseach ``FORMS_URLFIELD_ASSUME_HTTPS``."

msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Django 5.1 release notes <deprecated-features-5.1>` for more "
"details on these changes."
msgstr ""
"Féach na:ref: `Nótaí scaoileadh Django 5.1 <deprecated-features-5.1>`le "
"haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí faoi na hathruithe seo."

msgid ""
"The ``ModelAdmin.log_deletion()`` and ``LogEntryManager.log_action()`` "
"methods will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Bainfear na modhanna ``ModelAdmin.log_Deletion () ``agus "
"`LogentryManager.log_action ()``."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``django.utils.itercompat.is_iterable()`` function and the "
"``django.utils.itercompat`` module will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Bainfear an fheidhm ``django.utils.itercompat.is_iterable () "
"``neamhdhoiciméadaithe agus an modúl ``django.utils.itercompat``."

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2.coords()`` method will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear an modh ``Django.contrib.gis.geoip2.geoip2.coords () ``."

msgid "The ``django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2.open()`` method will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear an modh ``Django.contrib.gis.geoip2.geoip2.open () ``."

msgid ""
"Support for passing positional arguments to ``Model.save()`` and "
"``Model.asave()`` will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Bainfear tacaíocht chun argóintí seasaimh a rith chuig `Model.save () ``agus "
"`Model.asave ()``."

msgid ""
"The setter for ``django.contrib.gis.gdal.OGRGeometry.coord_dim`` will be "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Bainfear an socraithe do ``Django.contrib.gis.gdal.ogrgeometry.coord_dim``."

msgid ""
"``django.urls.register_converter()`` will no longer allow overriding "
"existing converters."
msgstr ""
"Ní cheadóidh ``django.urls.register_converter () ``tiontairí atá ann cheana "
"a shárú a thuilleadh."

msgid "The ``check`` keyword argument of ``CheckConstraint`` will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear an argóint eochairfhocal ``seice`` de `CheckConstraint``."

msgid ""
"The ``OS_OPEN_FLAGS`` attribute "
"of :class:`~django.core.files.storage.FileSystemStorage` will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Bainfear an tréith ``OS_OPEN_FLAGS`` de:class: "
"`~django.core.files.storage.fileSystemStorage`."

msgid "The ``get_cache_name()`` method of ``FieldCacheMixin`` will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear an modh ``get_cache_name () ``de `FieldCachemixin``."

msgid "5.1"
msgstr "5.1"

msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Django 4.2 release notes <deprecated-features-4.2>` for more "
"details on these changes."
msgstr ""
"Féach na:ref: `Nótaí scaoileadh Django 4.2 <deprecated-features-4.2>`le "
"haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí faoi na hathruithe seo."

msgid "The ``BaseUserManager.make_random_password()`` method will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear an modh ``BaseUserManager.Make_Random_Password () ``."

msgid "The model's ``Meta.index_together`` option will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear rogha ``Meta.index_Together`` an tsamhail."

msgid "The ``length_is`` template filter will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear an scagaire teimpléad ``long_is ``."

msgid ""
